WEBVTT

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:50.350
The Zonder's emitting a special elementary particle, you say?

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.110
There's no mistake.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.650
When that Zonder shows up, we pick up traces of a...

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:59.390
...certain elementary particle, Z0, that we'd never find here on Earth.

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:00.650
In other words...

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.630
That means it's possible to build a Zonder detector using Element Z0.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:11.160
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:14.060
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:20.980
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:25.060
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:31.780
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.060
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:40.980
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:44.900
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:47.700
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:51.460
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:56.460
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:59.630
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:02.170
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:05.300
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.260
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:12.340
Dividing Driver!

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:19.980
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:25.860
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:28.810
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:32.700
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:34.520
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.560
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:40.130
Elementary Particle Z0

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.260
<i>Elementary Particle Z0</i>

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:50.940
I've finished the Zonder detector at last. I'm calling it the Z-Sensor!

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.570
Unfortunately, I didn't have time to downsize the battery pack or body...

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.990
No, for a prototype, it's more than sufficient.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:06.910
If we use it right, we can pre-empt those Zonder attacks, can't we?

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:10.830
Where's Hyuuma?

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.590
He went to investigate the area where a Zonder was sighted.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.420
Really, now.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.920
He's always going off on his own.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.770
Wow, just look at that pile-up!

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.520
Can you believe whoever's driving that runaway bike?

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.110
Runaway bike?

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.650
You've got to be kidding, Mamoru! Don't you know?

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:42.070
They're always on the news.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.370
A mysterious motorcycle has been racing around...

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:48.330
...smashing all the traffic lights and road signs!

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.790
Don't you have eyes, for heaven's sake?

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.710
You're the one who ran the traffic light!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.790
What traffic light? Do you see any traffic lights around here, you idiot?

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.460
I know it's the long way around, but why don't we take the overpass?

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:06.680
Thanks for nothing!

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:10.520
How can you take 2 freaking hours? Your motto is "Speedy Delivery"!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:14.150
I'm so sorry! Traffic was horrendous!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.110
Everyone's having a hard time, huh?

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:30.200
Mysterious
Runaway Bike!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.870
The mysterious runaway bike appears out of the blue...

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:30.080
...wreaking major havoc wherever it goes.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.920
Not only have countless traffic lights and road signs been destroyed, but...

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.470
Listen up, runaway bike!

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:47.930
You are to pull over immediately! Pull over right now!

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.850
There's nowhere for you to escape now!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.150
Huh? How did that happen?

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:03.990
What the heck is that?

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.220
You're not getting away this time!

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.000
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.550
What are you doing? Go after that Zonder now!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.590
It is not feasible, due to our size.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:09.680
If that bike weaved onto a narrow road, there'd be nothing we could do.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.720
Curses!

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.350
Vacation to Hawaii

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:26.150
Then that particular Zonder is able to revert back to human form?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:31.200
Yes, I think Zonders can go back and forth between Zonder and human.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:35.750
I see, is that what your sensing ability is telling you, Mamoru?

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.120
It's just a feeling, but yes.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.080
Achoo!

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:48.050
Well, well, you see what happens to loose cannons?

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:51.180
Huh! I've got allergies, thank you very much!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:56.100
The current pollen count for the Big Order Room is 0.2 per cubic meter.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.810
That's not enough to trigger an allergic reaction!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.810
Shut your trap!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:12.780
That's one of our prime suspects
Ichiro Honda, aged 22.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.620
Listen, Major...

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.870
That's a motocross machine that he customized himself.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.160
He's quite the bike freak!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:21.710
Major, listen to me!

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:26.000
Shut up! Do you want to blow our cover?

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.760
Are you sure it's okay?

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.720
Not only did you take the Z-Sensor prototype without permission...

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.010
...but you're also running an unauthorized investigation...

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:37.010
May I remind you, we're doing this on our own time!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.180
Of course, as far as testing out the Z-Sensor is concerned...

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.940
...I think we're entitled to some Overtime...

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.270
But that would be <i>so</i> pushing it...

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.900
Still, I kind of like playing detective!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:55.780
The Z-Sensor Goggles, newly developed by GGG.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.040
An astounding invention with the ability to detect...

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.750
...the special elementary particle Z0 emitted by Zonders.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.130
He's on the move!

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:09.880
Okay, let's ride!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.010
All right, show yourself, you rotten Zonder!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:20.890
What the...

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:31.990
Hey, you! Are you all right?

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.990
My bike...

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.120
Ushi, are you getting a Zonder reading?

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:40.040
The thing is, he disappeared so fast...

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.250
Curses! That wretched Zonder...

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.170
So it turned back into a human, huh?

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.000
What was that all about, guys?

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:52.050
Darn, I wish I'd seen that Runaway Bike!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.760
Hey, that must be...

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:55.840
What's up?

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.260
Those are the Black Emperor Penguins.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.260
The what?

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:04.390
The biker gang, the Black Emperor Penguins, and their leader, Kawasaki.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.270
Suspect No. 2!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.900
Too bad, Kawasaki.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:09.820
Yeah.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:13.940
We lose the Zonder reading and then this guy shows up...

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.160
Which probably means...

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.460
The Inaugural World Motorcycle Festival

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:38.890
Ayame, there aren't that many people on line yet.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.850
Couldn't we have just come in the morning?

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.260
Uh-uh, no way!

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:45.850
They're going to showcase every rare bike from all over the world.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:50.860
Zundapp, Van Veen, Augusta, Brough Superior, Rikuo, KTM!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.190
Don't you want to see those babies before anyone else?

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.890
What the heck was that?

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.600
Was that the Runaway Bike everyone's talking about?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:26.560
Hey! My hot pot's ruined!

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.190
There's no mistake...

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:30.520
I'm getting a Zonder reading in the direction they went.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.610
For a moment there I thought we'd lost it...

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.730
...but it's showing its face at last!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:36.900
We're almost there...

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.570
Oh no! It's gone!

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:40.700
What?

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:42.580
Major! Look over there!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.840
Get a hold of yourself! What the heck happened?

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.880
It got us...

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.760
The runaway bike!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:57.880
What did you say?

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:00.590
Then the runaway bike's true identity must be...

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.600
Major! I'm picking up something!

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:06.270
3 km behind us, and it's headed this way!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:07.810
Are you serious?

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:10.900
Just 2 km away now. Man, it's quick!

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.980
Huh? It's gone again.

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:24.490
Curses! Darn that Zonder...

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.540
It must've realized we were tailing it.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:37.090
It's a Highway Patrolman.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.880
Highway Patrol?

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:40.800
Wait, no way!

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.600
Right, it's that cop from...

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.270
Watch your step. That's the Zonder.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.110
What?

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.490
Ushi! Pick up anything?

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:02.780
No, nothing yet.

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:19.090
What's that? Hyuuma went out on his own?

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:21.840
Yes, and it looks like he took the Z-Sensor with him.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:23.800
What about the runaway bike?

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.970
It's been spotted in the gulf area!

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:29.270
HyoRyu, EnRyu, prepare to launch!

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.160
Care to tell me what's going on here?

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.750
Was it you who caused all this?

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.210
Who would've thought you'd be lurking among the cops.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.630
Now that's what you call a blind spot!

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:07.890
I bet you think you're pretty clever, but you know what? You can't fool me!

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.260
What are you talking about?

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.770
All right, show us who you really are!

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.020
Zonder reaction! It's from above!

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.020
What?

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:22.940
So I was wrong?

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.250
Sorry to keep you waiting, Major!

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.040
Gai!

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:41.050
Hey, you guys, we were looking for you!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.050
Mamoru!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.710
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:50.720
Oh man, you mean that cop's <i>not</i> the Zonder?

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.060
Watch it, guys! It's not dead yet!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:56.230
HyoRyu, EnRyu! Get the Pencil Launcher ready!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:57.390
Roger!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:01.980
Oh, crud!

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.900
I never thought it could regenerate that fast!

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.410
Ayame, let's go home now!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.080
For Pete's sake, why?

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.910
Well, what are we gonna do if that runaway bike comes back?

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.790
It's not a matter of <i>what</i> we're gonna do...

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.290
...if that bike comes back I'm gonna get a good look at it for sure!

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:22.960
I mean, it came through here so fast we couldn't see anything.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:28.680
Here it is!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.300
Equip!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.720
No! It's gigantic now!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.020
Get out of here, everyone!

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:19.980
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.980
System Change!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:57.220
What the...

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:57.850
It's quick!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:03.520
Uh-oh!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:04.940
EnRyu!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.280
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:16.780
Galeon!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.790
Fusion!

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:41.930
GaiGar!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.350
Come on, everyone! This way!

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:48.770
Hana! Where are you?

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.940
What? Hana?

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.540
GaiGar is signaling for you to approve Final Fusion!

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:03.250
All right! Final Fusion, approved!

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:04.330
Roger!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:08.290
Final Fusion, Program Drive!

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:15.590
Final Fusion!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:02.560
GaoGaiGar!

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:10.060
Broken Magnum!

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.320
Did we get it?

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:20.200
Huh?

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.410
Hana!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.340
Hana!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.430
Nuts! They're like a swarm of ants!

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:45.640
What the...

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.440
Hana! Hana!

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:53.570
Hang on! You've to hang on!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.700
That was a close call.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:08.710
I'll take your friend to where she'll be safe.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.380
Special Agent Mamoru, you must go to GaoGaiGar's aid now.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.920
What's going on here, anyway?

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:26.220
Crap! It's attacking me with all these clones!

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:30.020
Still, the original's got to be in there somewhere!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:31.940
Which one is the original?

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.320
Major! Look at GaoGaiGar...

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.240
If he could just figure out which one's the original!

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:42.570
Hey, I got it!

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.660
This is the perfect time to make use of the Z-Sensor!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:49.120
What in tarnation? Nothing but Zonders!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.670
Massive amounts of Elementary Particle Z0 are being spread!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.250
Oh, my God!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:57.050
Man, what a useless piece of junk!

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:58.590
Where's Mamoru?

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:03.470
Big Brother Gai, let me handle this!

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:06.430
Mamoru! Stay away! It's too dangerous!

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:09.310
Hey, I'm on the GGG team, too!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.480
Okay, you're right!

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:32.370
That's the one!

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.710
It's just pretending to be wrecked!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.340
It's getting away!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.010
Not if I can help it!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.470
Broken Magnum!

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:47.720
No!

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.850
Pencil Launcher!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.520
Caught you off guard, Zonder!

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:02.280
Hell and Heaven!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:07.740
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo...

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:32.220
Is it over now?

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:33.640
You did it!

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.230
But who was it that got Zonderized, I wonder?

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:38.100
Huh?

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.360
Wait, come to think of it...

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:42.280
Coctura!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.330
Gotta make those deliveries, gotta deliver...

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.410
Huh? It's the pizza delivery girl!

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:58.540
You're in my way, truck!

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:01.380
Oh, but who cares anymore?

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.720
The bikes...

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.640
All those bikes from around the world...

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:13.520
We waited all night for nothing!

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:15.270
Huh?

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:18.400
Diminutive and highly mobile...

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:20.310
A new type of Zonder that has the ability...

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:22.270
...to slowly debilitate an entire city's infrastructure.

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:26.240
Apparently the enemy is refining its strategy with every attack.

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:30.570
Still, why have the Zonderians chosen to emit the Elementary Particle Z0?

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:32.950
Only one thing is certain.

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:35.700
If they succeed in blanketing us with that elementary particle...

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:38.870
...mankind will be Zonderized to the last person.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:40.540
What?

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.350
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.220
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:01.400
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:06.190
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.360
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:17.290
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:24.050
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:28.710
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:34.050
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.950
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:48.440
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:51.740
A Deep-Sea Submersible Zonder has escaped to the bottom of the ocean...

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:53.200
...carrying Hana and Mamoru.

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:55.620
Mobilize the Multidimensional Intelligence Ship!

00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:57.990
Execute GGG underwater protocol!

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:01.210
The question is, can our King of Braves withstand the pressure...

